WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:06.120
<i>It was a story of two queens.</i>

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:11.120
<i>It was a story of death and rebirth.</i>

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:14.440
<i>It was the sad tale about these</i>

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.250
<i>strange flags and the 
heroes involved with them.</i>

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.710
<i>There was once a peaceful country that</i>

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.550
<i>two beautiful princesses ruled.</i>

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.220
<i>But the country was</i>

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.710
<i>plunged into darkness by demons.</i>

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.350
<i>The goddess in heaven was 
tainted by the darkness,</i>

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.490
<i>and she entrusted her power 
to a boy who was soon to die.</i>

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.250
<i>She altered his appearance, 
changing him into a single flag.</i>

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:43.760
<i>It was the Royal Flag that was to 
change the fate of the kingdom.</i>

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.440
<i>The light which would 
drive away the darkness.</i>

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.640
<i>To drive away the despair</i>

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.780
<i>that threatened the kingdom,</i>

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.180
<i>the princesses and heroes fought...</i>

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:55.450
<i>But</i>

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:59.150
<i>the knight, magician,</i>

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:02.390
<i>bishop, and ninja lost their 
lives at the first gate.</i>

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.020
<i>At the second gate,</i>

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.660
<i>the samurai fell victim to a 
curse while protecting the flag,</i>

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.140
<i>and lost all of her memories.</i>

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:14.730
<i>At the third gate, due 
to the demon's schemes,</i>

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>the queen was separated from the heroes,</i>

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.770
<i>took the flag, and tried to escape...</i>

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:32.320
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.980
<b>Flag 9</b>

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.980
<b>Someday, it'd be Nice if We Could 
all Go to a Festival Together Again</b>

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:03.300
What is this, this here?

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.160
It's popcorn.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:11.390
It's exploding...

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:14.540
I can't believe the common people 
risk their lives to make snacks.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.790
I'm sure several people have died just

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:20.650
to figure out how to make this treat,

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:21.330
they have!

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.930
It's not that dangerous!

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.740
So how long will it take 
to get to the castle?

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.120
Don't know.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:34.940
Things were pretty crazy. I'm 
sure they'll be coming to get us.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.690
Don't say this to anyone else, but the 
Majesty doesn't have much time left.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:41.570
I might not matter,

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.150
but I'm sure they'll do something

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:46.310
to make sure Hakua gets there in time.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.630
The guys from The Council of 
the Seven Virtues will, anyway.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:52.870
What... did you just say?

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:01.760
What's up with these guys?

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.060
Don't be afraid.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.820
They're from the Council 
of the Seven Virtues.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.810
The crown prince has ordered 
me to bring you back.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:18.920
Yes.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.780
The Council of the Seven Virtues 
is a special organization

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.170
that rules over the populace, 
along with the throne.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:28.490
They're protectors of the Bladefield, 
founded along with the country itself.

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:32.560
<i>The Council of the Seven Virtues... 
Mei worked with them, right?</i>

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.000
<i>Why are they in this country?</i>

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.840
Wow. It's a real castle.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.810
Souta-kun!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.840
Don't worry me like that.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.520
Okiku-nee.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.880
I heard what happened from Ruri.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:01.610
Don't worry us so much.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.070
I'm glad you're all right.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:06.750
We weren't sure what to do...

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.500
Mei-oneechan helped us

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.260
contact the people at the castle.

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:13.580
She was really helpful.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:17.580
I-I wasn't really worried 
about Hatate Souta at all.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.420
Anyway, I'm glad you're all right, Souta-kun.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:23.140
Sorry, everyone.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:26.930
Anyway, Nanami, Hakua and I are all fine.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.850
Hakua... You mean her?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.520
Huh?!

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:37.240
A-Aren't you getting a little too 
close to the princess there,

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.500
Hatate Souta?

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.480
I, uh...

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.650
Nanami, Hakua.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.800
B-Brother Elia.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.240
Crown Prince.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.230
I'm glad you're all right,

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:52.230
my lovely princesses.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.130
You're Hatate Souta-kun, correct?

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.500
Thank you for helping them.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.500
Oh, no. Not at all.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.670
This is our brother.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.620
The Crown Prince, Elia.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.760
He's a nice person that cares for us,

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.180
even when our father doesn't 
seem to pay us much attention.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:15.890
Number Seven.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.530
Number Seven?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.650
Are you sure you're not mistaking 
me for someone else?

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.110
So you don't remember me, Number Zero?

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:31.010
Have we met somewhere before?

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:34.140
Excuse me.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.150
It seems you're not the right person.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.710
You done?

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:44.780
Yes.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:47.940
All the opposition forces have been subdued.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.970
Now your rule is secure.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.500
Is that supposed to mean something?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.520
You let the opposition forces 
know about those two,

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:59.980
and baited them into that 
assassination attempt.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.810
And the mere moment they failed,

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.230
you cast them aside.

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:08.510
You are the sharpest among 
the kings we have seen.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:12.130
However, we cannot have 
your heir be a common fool.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.030
I merely tested them.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.790
And if something

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:20.410
happened to them...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:24.460
We only need to create new heirs.

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:26.490
But do not worry.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.990
The heavenly destiny they carry...

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.930
They may even be the fated rulers.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.090
And you're saying that

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:37.430
this is how you've been 
protecting this country?

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.210
It is the mission of the 
Council of the Seven Virtues

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:43.940
to watch over the world, my new King.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:52.030
It's me.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:53.730
Get ready.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:55.700
Why

00:07:56.570 --> 00:08:00.080
is everyone collecting in my room when 
we've come all the way to Bladefield?!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:03.900
This is my first time watching television, it is!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.590
Did they really keep you that sheltered?

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.110
Brother?

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:11.670
What type of press conference is this?

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.930
<i>My beloved citizens.</i>

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.450
<i>My father, who has been bedridden 
for the past few days,</i>

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.620
<i>Allbad Bladefield,</i>

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.430
<i>passed away this morning.</i>

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:27.690
Father had already passed away...

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.020
<i>There is a reason this announcement 
has come to you all late.</i>

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:34.310
<i>As soon as my father passed away, 
the second crown prince and</i>

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.480
<i>the other princes below him, in other words,</i>

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:39.160
<i>my brothers, plotted to capture the crown,</i>

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:42.540
and were subdued.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.720
In order to corner me into submission,

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:49.380
they attempted to assassinate the thirteenth 
and fourteenth crown princesses.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.970
Fortunately, with help from 
good men, they were stopped.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.680
Please wait, your Highness.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.820
If they were trying to obtain 
the crown for themselves,

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:00.110
why would they attack the princesses with

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.180
the least right to inherit the throne?

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.880
That is because the thirteenth and

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:07.940
fourteenth have a secret 
regarding their birth.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:11.120
A secret regarding our birth?

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:15.490
In actuality, their father is not

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:17.110
Allbad Bladefield.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:21.200
I am their true father.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:28.710
They are my successors.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.110
Sorry to have you all come, 
and then have this happen...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.230
Y-You don't have to worry about it.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.820
My friend's fathers are just like my own.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:00.610
So does that make us princesses, too?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:01.950
Princesses?!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.790
I'm Souta's...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.220
It sounds like we're talking 
about something else now.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:10.220
Well, I guess it wasn't my 
father, but my grandfather.

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:12.590
After a three-day mourning period,

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:15.000
along with the coronation of the new king,

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.450
the town will have a celebration.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:21.680
At least try to have some 
fun there, at least.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:32.610
She was really cared for,

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.830
so I guess she still hasn't worked 
out her feelings because of that.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.030
Are you okay, Nanami?

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.860
You don't seem too chipper yourself.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.580
What?

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:45.130
I keep telling you I wasn't that close to—

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:48.120
You're upset that you aren't as 
upset as you thought you'd be.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.320
You don't have to worry about 
thinking you're so emotionless.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:55.840
The fact you're worried about that 
right now is proof that you aren't.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:02.340
You sure understand what people are thinking.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.170
Some people are good at analyzing 
others, especially you.

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:08.230
Except I still can't see 
anything with you, though.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:14.000
Long live the Bladefield kingdom!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.570
Cheers to his highness, Elia!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.920
This is wonderful.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.570
It's almost like I'm in a fantasy book!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.820
It's like we're in a land of dreams!

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.780
This is good, Onee-sama, it is.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.080
Pay before you start eating!

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:33.680
I'm glad Hakua seems happier now.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.770
Yeah, you're right.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:37.960
We finally found you.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.640
You can't just stand around here.

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:42.800
Hurry up. You're almost on.

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.530
Whoa, wait!

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.520
What's going on?

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:53.410
It seems that they've mistaken you for

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.150
the people who were supposed 
to be in an event.

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.770
I would expect nothing less, Souta-san.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:59.030
S-Souta-kun.

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:00.610
Huh?

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.990
The bride in the parade was beautiful.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.620
It's my first time seeing someone so cute.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.590
They said there's a bride.

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:11.170
How romantic.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:13.120
How about we go take a look?

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:17.250
Conquest Complete

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.630
Y-Yeah.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.250
I might want to get married myself.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:27.640
M-M-Megu-chan?!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.910
No!

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.420
Everyone saw me...

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:41.440
I can't be a beautiful bride now.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.820
<i>You wanted to be a bride?</i>

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.320
It's okay. We can just get 
Souta-kun to marry you.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.990
I can't be a bride. I need to be a groom.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.690
It's my first time being 
in a place like this.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:56.500
Festivals are such fun, they are!

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:58.050
Hey.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:12:59.750
You sure you're not pushing yourself?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.010
Huh?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:07.510
You were able to tell, you were.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.360
I just kinda got the feeling.

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.340
Souta-san, u-um...

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:16.480
Could we talk for a little bit, could we?

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:16.900
Huh?

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.580
You seem to be accustomed to trouble,

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.740
so I figured you'd be good 
for some advice, you would.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:26.120
Do I really seem that gloomy?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.160
No, not just that.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:35.410
I... believe I have a 
connection to you, I do.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:37.890
<i>This flag...</i>

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.920
I think Nanami would be better to talk to...

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.660
No, it has to be you, it does!

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.150
<i>I knew it...</i>

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.110
<i>It's the annoying girl flag...</i>

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:52.430
When we first met, you saved me...

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.770
I'm sure you'll be able to help 
me with everything, you will!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.100
<i>She trusts me too much...</i>

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:01.190
I figured I could trust you with anything, I did.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.780
<i>She's jumping to extremes.</i>

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.640
We're friends, right?

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.570
Friends that can talk 
about anything, right, right?

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.910
<i>It sounds like she can't live without me...</i>

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:13.130
So what did you want to talk about?

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.630
My father...

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.950
I mean, my grandfather passed away, correct?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.090
He treated me with a lot of affection.

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:27.380
I imagine everyone is carrying 
some pain due to his death,

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.840
but when I see everyone acting 
as if they've forgotten him...

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.330
This might seem a little heartless,

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.830
but I believe it's best for people to go about

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:40.520
their daily lives and not 
stop because of the dead.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.780
I'm sure your grandfather 
would rather see you smile,

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.280
than be sad and depressed.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:50.440
Souta-san...

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:53.030
Yes!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.520
Hakua-chan,

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.430
I'm sorry!

00:14:57.430 --> 00:15:01.710
We didn't notice you felt that way...

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.900
And then we dragged you out here...

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:05.300
I'm sorry.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.120
It's okay.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:11.050
I'm very happy you're so 
concerned about me, I am!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.850
Hakua-chan!

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.760
Everyone!

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.520
I'm so glad that everyone who 
loves Sou-kun has gotten closer!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.960
So I'm a member, too, am I?

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:22.860
Of course!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.400
As long as you have feelings for Souta!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:28.000
This is what it means to 
have a close friendship!

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.890
Would you all like to give a cheer?

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.030
Yes or no?

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.530
That's a good idea.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.500
Hooray! Hooray! Souta-kun!

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:38.300
You can do it, Souta-kun!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.940
You can do it, Souta-kun!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.920
<i>Why are they cheering for me and not Hakua?</i>

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.390
Thanks for helping Hakua.

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.640
I didn't really do anything on my own.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.180
I guess we're headed back to Japan tomorrow.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:57.230
A lot happened,

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.930
but I guess it was a fun summer vacation.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.130
This is...

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:21.410
Are you interested in that inscription?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.340
You're...

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.690
I guess I haven't told you my name, yet.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.820
I am Number Zero.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.920
Number Zero...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.570
Number Seven,

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.930
Daimyouzamurai Mei's, former superior.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:37.930
Huh?

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.580
This inscription is a fairy tale,

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:45.550
told in the lands from which 
Bladefield's founding queen hailed.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:47.440
A fairy tale.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:51.100
It was the tale of two queens.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.800
As the heroes fell, one by one,

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:57.750
a royal flag was raised aloft by

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.370
the last survivor, a golden haired princess.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.820
The demons fled,

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:04.960
and the kingdom regained the light,

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:08.960
but with the last arrow fired by the demons,

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.510
the princess lost her life.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:15.860
The boy of the flag had received 
a blessing from the goddess.

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.850
But the boy used that blessing

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:21.170
to revive the princess and

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.900
the others instead of 
healing his own illness.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.960
He remained in the shape of the royal 
flag, never to return to normal.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.960
The princesses and her comrades made this

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.400
torn flag the symbol of the country.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:38.180
It is the story of a boy with no name.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:43.410
It is the story of hope and despair.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:47.670
It is the tragic story of a young man,

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.000
the hero who turned into a strange 
flag and saved a country.

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.020
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:56.870
<i>It matches up too closely with my past...</i>

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:08.140
<i>If this fairy tale is a 
metaphor for my life,</i>

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.110
<i>then that means I will only meet</i>

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:15.440
<i>...destruction...</i>

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.390
<i>Is everything I do pointless?</i>

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:25.120
<i>Is the light I've finally found meaningless?</i>

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:28.330
What is the world to you?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.340
Why are you...

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:33.920
Is it a symbol of hatred?

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:35.590
Or do you

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.750
love it so much you'd sacrifice 
anything to protect it?

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:44.710
<i>I... The world...</i>

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.030
It won't go away...

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:51.890
I've triggered every flag I can think 
of that can get around a death flag!

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:54.410
But it still won't go away!

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.790
It won't go away! It won't go away!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.010
It won't go away!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:03.030
Are you embarrassed that you 
were the only one who survived?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.210
You're the one who killed him!

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.460
Give them back! You murderer!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:09.600
No,

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:14.210
the death flag is gathering everyone's 
anger and trying to kill me...

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:15.250
Die.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:17.970
No one really wants that.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:18.800
Die.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.760
No. No.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.640
Die. Die.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.140
No. No. No.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.520
Die. Die. Die. Die. Die.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:29.370
No!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:34.770
I'll take it with me...

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.730
I'll take the hatred caused by this flag...

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.380
This world...

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.250
I'll...

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.990
I love the world.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:09.560
I would easily kill a single 
princess for the sake of world.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.060
You couldn't...

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:16.230
Yes, I was behind that assassination attempt.

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:20.040
I wanted to see how capable the 
succeeding princesses would be,

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:22.070
and get rid of the opposition 
in one fell swoop.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.570
Pretty good plan, right?

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.330
You...

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:27.250
Of course,

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.330
I would give my life if necessary, as well.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.750
<i>She's serious...</i>

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.080
<i>For the world, she'd...</i>

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:39.340
I shall ask you once more. How do you feel?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:42.840
About the world that didn't need you?

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:45.530
I...

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:47.500
I...

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:51.600
Let us meet again.

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:56.230
I would be happy to

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:57.480
hear your answer then.

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:52.740
I shall praise you for

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:55.810
deceiving us and escaping from your bonds.

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.000
However, it is pointless.

00:22:58.370 --> 00:23:01.780
Someone like you will never be able to save

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:03.680
Hatate Souta.

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:07.490
Save my beloved brother.

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:12.440
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:14.860
Have you done the preview before, Hakua?

00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:16.690
I'm a Bladefield princess.

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:19.260
I can handle the preview with ease, I can!

00:23:19.260 --> 00:23:20.750
That's great.

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:23.840
So what is it, this preview?

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:25.850
I thought that flag was coming!

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:29.180
By the way, next time I'll 
start studying in Japan.

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:31.510
I don't think it has much to 
do with this preview, I don't.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Hold this for Me. 
The Winner of the Beauty Contest is Written Here.</b>

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Flag 10</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.130
That's a preview!

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:34.780
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Watch next time!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Tiv
